urant item, and are widely sold frozen for home use. There are also vegetarian \"chicken\" versions made from meat alternatives that are coated in bread as the standard ones are."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-chicken-nugget"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chicken_nugget"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["American cuisine","cuisine/american-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":2,"links":[["Breadcrumbs","ingredient/breadcrumbs"],["Chicken","ingredient/chicken"]]},{"h":"More from American cuisine","links":[["5-8 Club","dish/5-8-club"],["Altabira City Tavern","dish/altabira-city-tavern"],["Angel food cake","dish/angel-food-cake"],["Applebee's","dish/applebee-s"],["Arby's","dish/arby-s"],["Arnold's Bar and Grill","dish/arnold-s-bar-and-grill"],["Banana bread","dish/banana-bread"],["Banana pudding","dish/banana-pudding"],["Barbecue sauce","dish/barbecue-sauce"],["Be Our Guest Restaurant","dish/be-our-guest-restaurant"],["Beer cake","dish/beer-cake"],["Ben's Chili Bowl","dish/ben-s-chili-bowl"],["Benjy's","dish/benjy-s"],["Besaw's","dish/besaw-s"],["Better than sex cake","dish/better-than-sex-cake"],["Blackhawk (restaurant)","dish/blackhawk-restaurant"],["Blini","dish/blini"],["Blooming onion","dish/blooming-onion"],["Bobcat Bite","dish/bobcat-bite"],["Boiling Springs Tavern","dish/boiling-springs-tavern"],["Brix Tavern","dish/brix-tavern"],["Brown Betty (dessert)","dish/brown-betty-dessert"],["Brown Derby","dish/brown-derby"],["Brunswick stew","dish/brunswick-stew"],["Buffalo wing","dish/buffalo-wing"],["Buona","dish/buona"],["Busboys and Poets","dish/busboys-and-poets"],["Butter cake","dish/butter-cake"],["Byways Cafe","dish/byways-cafe"],["Caesar salad","dish/caesar-salad"],["California Grill","dish/california-grill"],["Camp Washington Chili","dish/camp-washington-chili"],["Caramel apple","dish/caramel-apple"],["Carbonara","dish/carbonara"],["Carnation Cafe","dish/carnation-cafe"],["Cheesesteak","dish/