 jam","dish/eggplant-jam"],["İmam bayıldı","dish/imam-bay-ld"],["İskender kebap","dish/iskender-kebap"],["Kavurma","dish/kavurma"],["Keşkek","dish/keskek"],["Kuru fasulye","dish/kuru-fasulye"],["Kyopolou","dish/kyopolou"],["Mesir macunu","dish/mesir-macunu"],["Nevzine tatlısı","dish/nevzine-tatl-s"],["Ntolmás","dish/ntolmas"],["Pilaf","dish/pilaf"],["Piyaz","dish/piyaz"],["Qatlama","dish/qatlama"],["Rakı","dish/rak"],["Şıllık","dish/s-ll-k"],["Sofra (restaurant)","dish/sofra-restaurant"],["Stuffed leaves","dish/stuffed-leaves"],["Stuffed peppers","dish/stuffed-peppers"],["Stuffed squash","dish/stuffed-squash"],["Stuffed tomatoes","dish/stuffed-tomatoes"],["Taramasalata","dish/taramasalata"],["Yayla çorbası","dish/yayla-corbas"]]}],"img":{"src":"/labs/cuisines/img/thumb/b/b2/Wedding_soup_from_the_Turkish_cuisine.jpg/500px-Wedding_soup_from_the_Turkish_cuisine.jpg","w":500,"h":375,"by":"E4024","lic":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wedding_soup_from_the_Turkish_cuisine.jpg"}},"dish/freddo-cappuccino":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/freddo-cappuccino","n":"Freddo cappuccino","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Greek cuisine","dot":"#cf5f87","intro":[["Coffee drinks are made by brewing water with ground coffee beans. The brewing is either done slowly, by drip, filter, French press, moka pot or percolator, or done very quickly, under pressure, by an espresso machine. When put under the pressure of an espresso machine, the coffee is termed espresso, while slow-brewed coffees are generally termed brewed coffee. While all coffee drinks are based on either coffee or espresso, some drinks add milk or cream, some are made with steamed milk or non-dairy milks, or add water (like the americano). Upon milk additions, coffee's flavor can vary with different syrups or sweeteners, alcoholic liqueurs, and even combinations of coffee with espresso or tea. There are many variations to the basic coffee or espresso bases."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-freddo-cappuccino"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Freddo_cappuccino"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Greek cuisine","cuisine/greek-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Dimitra's Dishes","ref":"site/dimitrasdishes-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"dimitrasdishes.com","note":"Dimitra Alfieris's video channel and blog focused on classic Greek home cooking.","url":"https://dimitrasdishes.com","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from Greek cuisine","links":[["Alexis Restaurant","dish/alexis-restaurant"],["Avgolemono","dish/avgolemono"],["Baba ghanoush","dish/baba-ghanoush"],["Bouyiourdi","dish/bouyiourdi"],["Cabbage roll","dish/cabbage-roll"],["Dametra Cafe","dish/dametra-cafe"],["Diples","dish/diples"],["Fasolada","dish/fasolada"],["Greek restaurant","dish/greek-restaurant"],["Greek salad","dish/greek-salad"],["İmam bayıldı","dish/imam-bay-ld"],["Kakavia (soup)","dish/kakavia-soup"],["Kalitsounia","dish/kalitsounia"],["Karydopita","dish/karydopita"],["Keşkek","dish/keskek"],["Ladera","dish/ladera"],["Noumboulo","dish/noumboulo"],["Pithari Taverna","dish/pithari-taverna"],["Psarosoupa","dish/psarosoupa"],["Spanakorizo","dish/spanakorizo"],["Taramasalata","dish/taramasalata"],["Tzatziki","dish/tzatziki"],["Yia Yia Mary's","dish/yia-yia-mary-s"]]}],"img":{"src":"/labs/cuisines/img/thumb/b/b3/Coffee_drinks.jpg/500px-Coffee_drinks.jpg","w":500,"h":980,"by":"Compilation by User:SilkTork, using images taken from various authors: Cafe bombon:…","lic":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Coffee_drinks.jpg"}},"dish/fregula":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/fregula","n":"Fregula","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Sardinian cuisine","dot":"#cf5f87","intro":[["Fregula (often written fregola) is a type of semolina  pasta from the Sardinia 